WEBVTT

00:04.000 --> 00:06.740
You've finally started to 
show your inner Honki!

00:09.550 --> 00:13.180
Well, I am the only one fit to 
take over after Marito-san...

00:13.180 --> 00:15.370
and capture Mahoro-chan's heart.

00:17.110 --> 00:20.180
Huh? She isn't here today?

00:20.180 --> 00:22.740
Ara-pyon!

00:22.740 --> 00:24.000
Mon...

00:24.000 --> 00:25.550
gory!

00:25.550 --> 00:28.130
You were so awesome with that virgin punch!

00:28.130 --> 00:29.760
You totally blew my mind!

00:29.760 --> 00:31.400
You gotta take me on, too!

00:31.400 --> 00:32.640
Not a chance!

00:32.640 --> 00:34.000
Aw, come on, man!

00:32.640 --> 00:35.100
Ow, ow, ow!

00:34.270 --> 00:35.100
Ara-chan.

00:35.710 --> 00:37.680
I need to talk to you about something.

00:37.680 --> 00:41.920
Hard pass. I gotta go find 
Mahoro-chan. I'm too busy.

00:41.920 --> 00:45.690
If you mean Jin-san, she's been at the 
hospital watching over Marito-kun.

00:48.020 --> 00:49.600
Vroom!

00:49.600 --> 00:51.050
Hey, wait up!

02:21.120 --> 02:24.210
<b>#07 Group Date?! The Sea, Maji Croquette, and I!</b>

02:22.150 --> 02:24.250
Thank you very much.

02:28.550 --> 02:30.290
Listen, Ara-chan.

02:30.290 --> 02:31.340
Hmm?

02:31.340 --> 02:33.550
Do you remember my big brother?

02:33.550 --> 02:37.270
Yeah, you mean Mitsukuni? Sure I do.

02:37.270 --> 02:38.260
How is he?

02:39.230 --> 02:42.580
Actually, he's in juvie right now.

02:42.580 --> 02:44.520
Huh? Juvie?

02:45.600 --> 02:46.880
Two years ago,

02:48.160 --> 02:52.790
he beat up a cop who was 
forcing his buddies to sell drugs.

02:55.220 --> 02:58.590
When he said goodbye, he told me something.

03:01.660 --> 03:06.910
"Keep working at becoming a Honki Person. 
I know you've got what it takes."

03:08.260 --> 03:11.560
Those words have kept me going all this time.

03:15.160 --> 03:17.440
I guess you've been through a lot, too.

03:19.730 --> 03:23.320
Anyway, my brother's coming home next week.

03:24.350 --> 03:26.930
Oh, yeah? That's great.

03:26.930 --> 03:28.060
Yeah!

03:29.320 --> 03:32.570
Big Brother, are you okay? Does it hurt?

03:32.570 --> 03:34.820
I made you lunch!

03:37.320 --> 03:40.420
If you eat this, it'll fix you right up!

03:40.970 --> 03:42.450
Open wide.

03:54.560 --> 03:57.770
A-A-Arajin's the strongest one!

03:57.770 --> 03:58.530
Heave-ho!

03:58.530 --> 04:01.390
All of the girls go head over heels for him...

04:01.390 --> 04:02.190
Heave ahoy!

04:02.190 --> 04:05.000
They fall so hard they can't 
stand it, like Mahoro-chan!

04:02.640 --> 04:07.270
<b>Jin Marito</b>

04:05.000 --> 04:07.270
Ara-teen!

04:08.450 --> 04:09.950
H-Hello...

04:09.950 --> 04:12.650
Wow, Mahoro-chan? What a coincidence!

04:15.610 --> 04:18.260
Why'd that creepy rock guy have to show up?

04:18.260 --> 04:22.300
M-Mahoro-chan, if you keep 
looking at me like that, I'll just...

04:22.300 --> 04:24.950
What took you so long, Ara-teen?

04:24.950 --> 04:26.690
So how are you feeling?

04:26.690 --> 04:31.780
I've had it! If I stay here, 
I'm gonna start going crazy!

04:31.780 --> 04:34.590
I thought you already were, though.

04:34.590 --> 04:37.340
Ha. Ha. Ha. Ha. Ha. Ha.

04:38.540 --> 04:42.580
Would you please leave? My brother 
can't have visitors who aren't family.

04:42.580 --> 04:44.470
Oh, I guess you're right.

04:44.470 --> 04:45.680
Mahoro.

04:45.680 --> 04:47.350
What is it, Big Brother?

04:47.350 --> 04:48.570
Leave.

04:57.170 --> 04:59.190
Mahoro-chan! Wait!

05:06.490 --> 05:09.540
Beating some rando 
doesn't make you the shit.

05:19.020 --> 05:23.590
Squee! Mahoro-chan just wall-slammed me!

05:33.020 --> 05:36.060
So, Ara-teen, I hear you put on quite a show.

05:36.060 --> 05:37.650
Oh, it was nothing special.

05:37.650 --> 05:41.180
But, dear brother, please leave 
Siguma and Mahoro-chan to me.

05:41.180 --> 05:43.610
Wanna go on a group date?

05:44.550 --> 05:46.830
What... was that?

05:48.240 --> 05:51.540
You like group dates, right?

05:52.850 --> 05:54.790
They're my most favorite thing ever!

05:55.170 --> 05:58.970
What?! Minato's coming, too?!

05:58.970 --> 06:01.550
That means Matakara's gonna be there.

06:01.830 --> 06:06.470
I always end up on the sidelines when 
he's around. Kinda cramps my style.

06:06.470 --> 06:09.430
Why'd you have to invite them, anyway?

06:09.770 --> 06:12.450
Why would we want to 
do it just by ourselves?

06:12.990 --> 06:14.940
<i>But... why wouldn't we?</i>

06:14.940 --> 06:18.270
Arajin-kun, you're gonna be super popular 
now that you've beaten Shindo!

06:18.270 --> 06:19.820
Super popular?!

06:20.220 --> 06:21.970
Let's let loose on the beach!

06:21.970 --> 06:23.350
Does that mean swimsuits?!

06:23.350 --> 06:24.470
Yes.

06:24.470 --> 06:25.960
And Mahoro-chan, too?!

06:25.960 --> 06:27.590
Yes!

06:28.760 --> 06:30.870
<i>In white? Yeah, definitely in white!</i>

06:30.870 --> 06:33.440
You might even see something 
better than a swimsuit.

06:38.560 --> 06:40.640
Yeah!

06:41.050 --> 06:43.050
<b>Aahar Bath</b>

06:43.630 --> 06:45.550
Group date!

06:46.000 --> 06:50.390
Group date! Group date! Group date date!

06:50.390 --> 06:53.680
This is gonna be fun! 
A group date with Ara-chan.

06:53.680 --> 06:57.190
Yeah, I've never seen anyone 
throw a punch like that!

06:57.190 --> 06:58.060
Yeah.

06:58.430 --> 07:01.940
It really was just like he was a Honki Person.

07:03.620 --> 07:04.700
Zabu?

07:05.060 --> 07:07.400
You okay? Lightheaded?

07:07.400 --> 07:09.760
Group date date!

07:10.200 --> 07:12.020
I'm not in the mood, man.

07:12.020 --> 07:12.950
Huh?

07:13.410 --> 07:16.630
I mean, I wasn't able to do anything before.

07:17.810 --> 07:20.350
Now I feel like I owe that guy something.

07:23.870 --> 07:26.990
I doubt that's how Ara-chan sees it, though.

07:26.990 --> 07:31.930
Besides, you saved me, remember?

07:42.120 --> 07:44.120
Yo, would you check out these muscles?

07:44.120 --> 07:46.160
I'm gonna rock tomorrow's group date!

07:46.160 --> 07:46.890
Where, though?

07:46.890 --> 07:47.980
Right here! Here!

07:49.200 --> 07:50.730
It's like a little preserved egg!

07:50.730 --> 07:52.450
Squishy, squishy!

07:52.450 --> 07:55.580
<b>Train
Properly,</b>

07:52.450 --> 07:55.580
<b>Enchant Them
 with Muscle.</b>

07:52.450 --> 07:55.580
<b>The Body They Want</b>

07:52.450 --> 07:55.580
Shut up! It's as hard as chow mein!

07:58.670 --> 08:00.980
Hey, Senya.

08:03.390 --> 08:07.880
I don't know, but I feel like 
I'm more of a man now.

08:08.680 --> 08:14.030
Yeah. The punch you knocked Akutaro 
out with was something to see.

08:16.400 --> 08:18.600
I guess I've got to go.

08:18.600 --> 08:21.730
Yeah! Let's take it as far as we can!

08:21.730 --> 08:24.440
All right. Then I'm going!

08:25.750 --> 08:27.320
To play beach volleyball,

08:28.130 --> 08:30.700
play tag in the surf,

08:31.220 --> 08:33.500
get into the perfect mood,

08:35.420 --> 08:36.300
and ki—

08:37.000 --> 08:38.130
ki—

08:38.580 --> 08:39.830
ki—

08:40.420 --> 08:44.920
Eee! I might just leave 
my virginity at the beach!

08:43.840 --> 08:44.920
Ya moron.

08:49.870 --> 08:52.130
I'm late! I'm late!

08:52.130 --> 08:55.510
Here I come!

08:56.010 --> 08:58.230
Welcome in!

08:58.850 --> 09:00.770
Same today?

09:03.090 --> 09:04.120
Pu'er-chan, please.

09:04.120 --> 09:05.480
Okay! Jasmi—

09:07.160 --> 09:08.140
Huh?

09:08.740 --> 09:11.410
Um, p-pleased to meet you.

09:11.410 --> 09:15.850
Actually, I... can't get the 
last girl out of my head.

09:15.850 --> 09:19.840
What? Pu'er-chan? You're just suddenly gonna...

09:24.570 --> 09:27.250
I have come to search for a small miracle.

09:27.580 --> 09:30.510
My name is Tomoshibi Arajin!

09:32.960 --> 09:33.960
Huh?

09:36.110 --> 09:41.000
Um, is this where the group date is?

09:42.140 --> 09:46.150
<b><b>Group Combat Date</b></b>

09:43.080 --> 09:46.150
Group... combat date?

09:46.150 --> 09:47.650
Huh?!

09:48.570 --> 09:52.660
I am pleased to announce 
that the Siguma Squad

09:52.860 --> 09:56.160
and Minato Kai group date has now begun!

09:56.160 --> 09:59.160
Yeah!

09:59.160 --> 10:00.910
What?!

10:01.250 --> 10:04.680
In the yellow corner, the gentle tyrant...

10:05.610 --> 10:09.130
Tahide Outa!

10:09.850 --> 10:13.620
In the blue corner, the silent messiah...

10:14.640 --> 10:18.070
Doman Kenichiro!

10:18.070 --> 10:20.140
Is this the... group date?

10:20.140 --> 10:21.640
Heave-ho!

10:21.640 --> 10:22.630
Fight!

10:23.140 --> 10:26.730
The fight has begun! 
Oh, they're already grappling!

10:27.480 --> 10:31.400
Into a headlock! 
He's squeezing him like a vise!

10:31.660 --> 10:35.390
Oh, he's picked him up! A backdrop!

10:34.110 --> 10:36.000
Outa-kun, get him!

10:35.390 --> 10:38.850
He was stuck in a headlock 
but managed to pull out!

10:38.850 --> 10:43.710
What's this? Kenichiro's in a 
headstand and isn't even moving!

10:44.670 --> 10:47.750
He's jumped up again! And he pulled it off!

10:47.750 --> 10:50.280
The Messiah's Ascending Clothesline!

10:49.250 --> 10:50.280
Ken-san!

10:50.280 --> 10:51.510
Outa-kun!

10:51.030 --> 10:55.510
That was overpowering! But Outa can take it!

10:51.510 --> 10:53.060
Stand up!

10:55.510 --> 10:57.940
He flat-out refused to ascend!

10:57.940 --> 11:00.860
Oh, boy! Kenichiro has the face of a demon!

11:00.860 --> 11:05.520
This could be extremely dangerous! 
Is he going to finish it like this?

11:05.520 --> 11:09.160
Huh? Oh, something's wrong with Kenichiro.

11:09.160 --> 11:10.520
Ken-san?!

11:09.160 --> 11:11.260
What could have happened?

11:14.480 --> 11:16.490
Kenichiro has thrown out his back!

11:16.820 --> 11:18.250
Doctor!

11:18.250 --> 11:19.490
Seriously?

11:19.490 --> 11:21.250
Oh, come on.

11:21.250 --> 11:22.330
Huh?

11:22.870 --> 11:26.750
The winner is Tahide Outa!

11:27.710 --> 11:29.380
Doctor! Here, too!

11:29.380 --> 11:31.970
How many fingers you see, sonny?

11:30.220 --> 11:31.970
That living fossil from the health room,

11:31.970 --> 11:34.780
Doctor Matsunaka,
is performing medical checks.

11:32.370 --> 11:33.570
A whole lot.

11:35.130 --> 11:38.570
Now I'm all hyped up, though!

11:35.130 --> 11:38.570
H-Hey! Whoa, Marito-kun! Calm down!

11:38.570 --> 11:39.250
Hey.

11:39.250 --> 11:41.570
Huh? Zabu... san?

11:41.570 --> 11:42.640
Lame.

11:42.960 --> 11:44.570
I'm gonna go hard.

11:44.570 --> 11:46.140
To pay back what I owe you.

11:46.770 --> 11:49.700
Huh? I ain't fighting nobody.

11:48.730 --> 11:50.980
<b>Minato Kai
Doman Kenichiro
Asamine Matakara</b>

11:48.730 --> 11:50.980
<b>m 0 0 l 180 0 180 100 0 100</b>

11:48.730 --> 11:50.980
<b>Siguma Squad
Jin Ma
Tahide Ou</b>

11:48.730 --> 11:50.980
<b>m 0 0 l 180 0 180 100 0 100</b>

11:51.190 --> 11:52.980
<b>Tomoshibi
Arajin</b>

11:51.700 --> 11:52.980
Huh?!

11:54.170 --> 11:59.240
Now, the image of... 
Mahoro-chan in a white bikini...

11:59.620 --> 12:01.070
is all I have left.

12:06.940 --> 12:08.030
It's black.

12:13.650 --> 12:15.970
Ow, ow, ow! I give up! Give up!

12:17.010 --> 12:18.550
Yes!

12:17.010 --> 12:21.420
The winner is Sakigake Komao!

12:21.420 --> 12:23.010
So who's next? Huh?

12:25.370 --> 12:27.230
Little ol' me!

12:27.880 --> 12:29.100
Big Brother!

12:29.100 --> 12:31.350
You're so cool! Look this way!

12:31.350 --> 12:32.850
Drag him out here.

12:31.770 --> 12:33.360
And your costume? Way too perfect!

12:34.940 --> 12:35.980
Palm strike!

12:35.980 --> 12:38.070
Komao!

12:38.990 --> 12:41.990
The winner is Jin Marito!

12:42.800 --> 12:44.690
Big Brother, you're a god!

12:44.690 --> 12:46.520
You're too godly! Too cool!

12:46.520 --> 12:47.890
How many?

12:46.990 --> 12:49.400
We will now have a short intermission.

12:47.890 --> 12:48.970
A bunch.

12:48.970 --> 12:50.000
Komao!

12:49.400 --> 12:51.760
We'll start the next fight right away,

12:51.760 --> 12:55.210
so please wash your hands and eat lunch 
now while you have the chance.

12:53.470 --> 12:55.750
I'm so hungry.

12:55.210 --> 12:57.710
There is food available outside the venue.

12:56.140 --> 12:57.710
Wait right here!

12:57.710 --> 12:58.800
For five.

12:58.800 --> 13:00.270
Hey, we were first!

13:00.270 --> 13:01.220
Hurry up!

13:01.220 --> 13:03.720
<b>Delicious</b>

13:01.220 --> 13:03.720
<b>Soba</b>

13:01.220 --> 13:03.730
C-Coming right up!

13:03.730 --> 13:07.630
Damn it! How dare they treat me 
like some kind of yakisoba machine?

13:08.030 --> 13:09.700
Hey, you listening?

13:10.620 --> 13:12.400
Put up with it for now.

13:12.400 --> 13:13.330
But...

13:13.330 --> 13:15.300
Two servings, please!

13:17.090 --> 13:18.440
Shindo-san...

13:23.070 --> 13:28.260
By the way, you said the name "Senya" 
before. Where did you hear that?

13:28.260 --> 13:29.480
Who knows?

13:33.050 --> 13:35.500
Why don't you ask him yourself?

13:38.760 --> 13:40.390
It's gonna start again.

13:41.270 --> 13:43.150
Quit pulling me!

13:48.220 --> 13:51.020
One! Two! Three!

13:51.360 --> 13:53.520
It's over! The winner is Matakara!

13:53.520 --> 13:55.770
Heave-ho, here we go!

13:55.770 --> 13:58.810
So far, he's taken seven people out!

13:59.900 --> 14:03.570
You're next, Zabu. 
Go show him you're the man!

14:03.570 --> 14:04.360
Hell yeah.

14:04.760 --> 14:06.580
All my frustration from before...

14:06.580 --> 14:08.950
I'm taking it out on you!

14:13.190 --> 14:15.920
Zabu! Don't die!

14:15.920 --> 14:17.130
Hey!

14:18.340 --> 14:19.710
Boom!

14:19.710 --> 14:21.740
Yay!

14:20.130 --> 14:22.970
The winner is Jin Marito!

14:23.300 --> 14:25.720
<i>I'm so glad I'm in Siguma.</i>

14:26.730 --> 14:31.470
Huh? Is Matakara the only one 
left on the Minato side?

14:31.470 --> 14:33.980
I won't have to fight after all!

14:34.310 --> 14:35.730
Yes!

14:36.530 --> 14:39.490
It just doesn't feel like enough yet.

14:40.710 --> 14:42.530
I'll make sure you don't regret it!

14:44.890 --> 14:47.280
Oh, I just had a great idea!

14:47.610 --> 14:50.040
I'll let Ara-teen fight on your side!

14:50.040 --> 14:51.100
Eh?

14:51.540 --> 14:55.750
Me and Jaba-chan versus Ara-teen 
and Matakara. Tag team, okay?

14:55.750 --> 14:58.440
No, no, we couldn't possibly do that!

14:58.440 --> 15:00.120
Right, Matakara?

15:00.120 --> 15:02.900
I'm actually... fine with it.

15:03.630 --> 15:05.380
Then it's settled!

15:05.380 --> 15:08.390
No! This is the worst thing 
that could happen!

15:08.800 --> 15:11.390
Hey! Let's merge! Right?

15:11.870 --> 15:15.390
I do want to merge. I want to merge so bad.

15:16.310 --> 15:19.230
But you know, even more than that...

15:20.260 --> 15:23.070
I wanna see your rock-hard Honki in action!

15:23.070 --> 15:24.470
This isn't the time for—

15:24.470 --> 15:25.780
Ara-chan!

15:29.810 --> 15:31.460
Let's do our best, okay?

15:34.610 --> 15:37.040
And now, the final match.

15:37.040 --> 15:40.290
Sudden death, no time limit. 
It's about to begin!

15:40.840 --> 15:42.050
In the blue corner,

15:42.050 --> 15:44.190
the giant type,

15:44.190 --> 15:48.180
Asamine Matakara!

15:48.740 --> 15:51.580
And the one-hit, one-kill agape boy,

15:51.580 --> 15:54.750
Tomoshibi Arajin!

15:56.490 --> 15:57.940
In the yellow corner,

15:58.320 --> 16:00.970
the rebellious and hard-headed

16:00.970 --> 16:03.690
Jabashiri Nagare!

16:04.120 --> 16:07.820
And that frenzied supernova,

16:07.820 --> 16:11.660
Jin Marito!

16:11.660 --> 16:13.870
Beat them up, Big Brother!

16:14.180 --> 16:16.130
I'll let you kick things off, Matakara.

16:16.130 --> 16:16.670
Okay!

16:16.670 --> 16:17.580
Fighters, step forward.

16:17.580 --> 16:19.580
<i>There's no way I'm gonna tag in.</i>

16:20.510 --> 16:22.140
Ready, fight!

16:21.330 --> 16:23.040
<b>Might</b>

16:23.040 --> 16:24.500
They're closing in...

16:24.780 --> 16:25.930
They're grappling!

16:26.920 --> 16:30.140
Now I'm gonna repay you for before!

16:30.140 --> 16:32.230
Jabashiri is pushing him back!

16:32.230 --> 16:35.810
Ah! A throat thrust! And now 
he's thrown him onto the rope!

16:35.810 --> 16:37.060
Something is coming!

16:37.410 --> 16:40.590
A head rocket! But he got right back up!

16:40.590 --> 16:44.600
Ah! A jumping knee right into 
the face! But he's up again!

16:44.600 --> 16:47.810
Drop kicks! And they're both hit!

16:47.810 --> 16:49.740
It's a battle of wills!

16:49.740 --> 16:53.670
That's it! Get him! Show us your Honki!

16:51.750 --> 16:53.670
Go, Matakara! Finish him off!

16:53.670 --> 16:54.910
Tag in! Tag in!

16:54.910 --> 16:57.910
Switch with him! Show your stuff, Big Brother!

16:59.040 --> 17:02.040
Matakara! Tag me!

17:03.730 --> 17:05.050
Ara-chan!

17:06.000 --> 17:08.380
<i>I'll show her what I've got!</i>

17:08.380 --> 17:10.100
You little piece of shit.

17:10.100 --> 17:11.630
Who the hell do you think you are?

17:11.630 --> 17:14.190
Jaba! Tag me!

17:14.640 --> 17:17.600
No, please, let me handle—

17:17.600 --> 17:20.560
Jaba-chan...

17:20.560 --> 17:22.310
S-Sure.

17:22.660 --> 17:25.820
Come to me, Ara-teen.

17:26.540 --> 17:29.580
Oh, ouch! Ow, ow, ow!

17:30.090 --> 17:31.080
What's wrong?

17:31.080 --> 17:34.540
I think I got a leg cramp. Ow...

17:34.540 --> 17:36.580
It's okay. I'll go instead.

17:36.580 --> 17:38.080
Having trouble?

17:37.100 --> 17:38.080
Boo.

17:38.690 --> 17:41.800
<i>If I try to show off now, 
I'll just get killed.</i>

17:41.800 --> 17:44.090
<i>I'll just let Matakara handle the rest.</i>

17:49.300 --> 17:52.180
He's fallen! One! Two! Th—

17:53.760 --> 17:56.350
Safe! Two-count! Two-count!

17:59.770 --> 18:01.770
Give up! Don't stand up!

18:01.770 --> 18:03.770
You'll be killed, Matakara!

18:04.160 --> 18:07.390
Huh. I didn't think you'd try so hard.

18:07.390 --> 18:09.150
I told you, didn't I?

18:09.530 --> 18:11.600
That I won't let you regret it!

18:12.670 --> 18:16.450
There it is! Marito's killer move, 
the King Cobra Twist!

18:16.960 --> 18:18.200
Matakara is enduring it!

18:18.200 --> 18:20.200
Ara-teen, you good?

18:20.200 --> 18:24.330
If you don't tag in,
your little doggie is gonna die.

18:24.820 --> 18:27.170
<i>Give up, Matakara!</i>

18:27.590 --> 18:30.380
<i>This is for fun! The fight doesn't even matter!</i>

18:36.610 --> 18:39.410
He broke his way out! Is his shoulder okay?

18:37.490 --> 18:38.470
Matakara!

18:39.410 --> 18:43.010
Ooh! An elbow! He's letting him have it!

18:46.130 --> 18:48.070
What determination!

18:48.070 --> 18:51.650
Even with his shoulder injured, Matakara 
counterattacked with a rolling sabat!

18:51.650 --> 18:53.650
However, it didn't—

18:55.790 --> 18:57.090
It did hit him!

18:57.090 --> 18:57.910
Nice job!

18:57.910 --> 19:00.410
Who could have expected this development?

18:58.360 --> 18:59.850
All right!

19:00.410 --> 19:04.540
This is unprecedented! This is huge!

19:13.510 --> 19:14.850
Bye-cha!

19:16.260 --> 19:18.540
Hey! It's a spicy Maji Kebab!

19:27.700 --> 19:30.480
Ara-teen!

19:32.400 --> 19:34.150
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

19:36.360 --> 19:38.570
Marito! No, no, no!

19:43.580 --> 19:47.580
A spicy Maji Kebab? Where?

19:55.690 --> 19:57.550
I'm your opponent!

19:58.350 --> 19:59.300
No, you're mine!

19:59.300 --> 20:01.340
You're gonna rip me apart!

20:01.340 --> 20:06.430
Ara-teen! Where's the Maji Kebab, Ara-teen?!

20:02.680 --> 20:04.520
You'll rip me apart!

20:06.430 --> 20:07.770
Yeah!

20:16.570 --> 20:18.320
Maji Kebab!

20:17.370 --> 20:18.320
Ara-chan!

20:19.780 --> 20:21.100
We're the ones

20:22.290 --> 20:24.100
winning today!

20:24.990 --> 20:26.500
They did it!

20:29.120 --> 20:32.590
Kebab!

20:43.510 --> 20:47.520
He's fallen! One, two, three!

20:50.770 --> 20:52.000
We did it!

20:52.000 --> 20:55.430
What a surprise! A historical upset!

20:54.850 --> 20:56.170
Wow!

20:55.430 --> 20:58.050
Arajin and Matakara came back to win!

20:56.170 --> 20:57.570
Damn it!

20:58.050 --> 20:59.740
Woo-hoo!

20:58.050 --> 20:59.740
I'll win the next one, man!

21:00.190 --> 21:02.370
Now that was a group date!

21:02.370 --> 21:03.370
Sure was!

21:03.370 --> 21:05.000
How many fingers?

21:05.000 --> 21:05.670
A bunch.

21:05.670 --> 21:06.870
Ara-chan!

21:09.290 --> 21:12.580
Hey, Matakara! Cut it out, man!

21:12.580 --> 21:14.710
Damn it!

21:14.710 --> 21:17.430
Let me fight them again!

21:23.490 --> 21:24.860
You just wait and see.

21:24.860 --> 21:27.060
Shut up! We'll make you eat those words.

21:27.060 --> 21:31.060
Hey! Don't eat the whole thing yourself!

21:29.770 --> 21:31.060
I'm so tired.

21:31.350 --> 21:33.190
That was so much fun!

21:33.190 --> 21:37.470
Fighting with you took me 
back to the good old days.

21:37.470 --> 21:41.490
We never did anything this messed-up then.

21:41.490 --> 21:43.920
I'm never doing this again.

21:45.640 --> 21:50.610
But winning the fight, and that 
blow that finished Shindo-san...

21:50.610 --> 21:53.010
You were almost like a real Honki Person!

21:54.370 --> 21:56.710
You really are incredible, Ara-chan!

21:57.970 --> 21:59.760
Enough already.

22:03.690 --> 22:05.890
Mahoro-chan!

23:45.030 --> 23:50.030
<b>Sad News!</b>

23:45.030 --> 23:50.030
<b>Seriously Falling in Love with Gomoku Soba!</b>

23:45.360 --> 23:48.170
Bucchigi-you again next week!
